{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://wonderland.local/technohab/canonical-values/1.0/schema",
  "title": "Valeurs canoniques TechnoHab",
  "description": "Contrat consommable des valeurs utilisées par les profils et le moteur. Une valeur HARD N3 est admise uniquement comme doctrine TechnoHab explicitement justifiée et bornée.",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["schemaVersion", "version", "values"],
  "properties": {
    "schemaVersion": { "const": "1.0" },
    "version": { "type": "string", "format": "date" },
    "values": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/canonicalValue" }
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "$defs": {
    "dimensions2d": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["width", "depth"],
      "properties": {
        "width": { "type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0 },
        "depth": { "type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0 }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "source": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["level", "kind", "reference"],
      "properties": {
        "level": { "enum": ["N1", "N2", "N3", "UNRESOLVED"] },
        "kind": { "enum": ["regulatory", "normative", "professional", "doctrinal", "unresolved"] },
        "reference": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "locator": { "type": "string" },
        "rationale": { "type": "string" }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "scope": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["roomProfiles", "jurisdiction", "buildingContext", "validFrom"],
      "properties": {
        "roomProfiles": { "type": "array", "minItems": 1, "uniqueItems": true, "items": { "type": "string" } },
        "variants": { "type": "array", "minItems": 1, "uniqueItems": true, "items": { "type": "string" } },
        "jurisdiction": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "buildingContext": { "type": "array", "minItems": 1, "uniqueItems": true, "items": { "type": "string" } },
        "validFrom": { "type": "string", "format": "date" },
        "validTo": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date" }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "canonicalValue": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["id", "version", "label", "quantity", "value", "unit", "status", "ruleLevel", "source", "scope"],
      "properties": {
        "id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^VAL-[A-Z0-9-]+$" },
        "version": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+$" },
        "label": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "quantity": { "enum": ["length", "area", "dimensions-2d", "ratio", "count", "score-weight"] },
        "value": {
          "oneOf": [
            { "type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0 },
            { "$ref": "#/$defs/dimensions2d" }
          ]
        },
        "unit": { "enum": ["m", "m2", "ratio", "spaces", "points-per-meter", "points-per-requirement"] },
        "status": { "enum": ["ADOPTED", "PROVISIONAL", "UNRESOLVED", "RETIRED"] },
        "ruleLevel": { "enum": ["HARD", "GUIDELINE", "PREFERENCE"] },
        "source": { "$ref": "#/$defs/source" },
        "scope": { "$ref": "#/$defs/scope" }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  },
  "invariants": [
    "Les identifiants sont uniques dans un registre.",
    "dimensions-2d emploie une valeur {width, depth} et l'unité m ; area emploie m2 ; ratio emploie ratio ; count emploie une unité dénombrable ; score-weight emploie une unité points-per-* explicitant son dénominateur.",
    "UNRESOLVED ne peut jamais gouverner une règle HARD.",
    "Une règle HARD N3 exige source.kind=doctrinal, une justification non vide et une portée complète.",
    "Une source UNRESOLVED exige un statut UNRESOLVED et réciproquement."
  ]
}
